o I've borrowed from lately, so do I owe Zbigniew Ortega anything at the moment?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to remember how often we've met up, so which calendar events is Sorrine Vavow on?\", \"That's a lot to wade through, could you narrow those down to just anything about Somchai?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0057\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please pull up the badminton club login for me?\", \"Also, would you mind telling me where my shopping list went?\", \"Actually, please don't bother with that, thank you.\", \"Could you tell me what else is in that notebook, though?\"], [\"I'm heading to a game tonight and can never remember how to sign in, so can you find the badminton club login entry?\", \"Oh and I was jotting things down in a shopping list last time and now I can't find it anywhere — where did the shopping list go?\", \"Ah, actually, I've just remembered I already bought most of it, so don't bother, leave it.\", \"Though now I'm curious, since I don't remember putting it there — what else is sitting in that notebook?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0058\", \"v\": [[\"um can you add Fleavis Fitzgerald to the, uh, the Seswick trip group\", \"oh and, um, what's Losuan's balance with me in the Wasoe group?\", \"ok so what's… what's on at Dreford Pavilion?\", \"hang on, actually — are there any birthdays or anniversaries coming up in the, like, next two months?\", \"ok right, back to the Pavilion stuff — what about, um, in my to-do list?\"], [\"Fleavis just said they're coming along after all, so could you add Fleavis Fitzgerald to the Seswick trip group?\", \"Separate thing — I feel like we've been going back and forth for ages, so what's Losuan's balance with me in the Wasoe group?\", \"I've been meaning to get out of the house more, so what's on at Dreford Pavilion?\", \"Wait, quick one before I forget, because I always miss these — what birthdays or anniversaries are there in the next two months?\", \"Okay, going back to the Pavilion thing from before, I feel like I jotted something down about it — what about in my to-do list?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0059\", \"v\": [[\"I've got a feeling I've been splashing out a bit too much lately, so how much have I actually spent recently?\"], [\"how much spent recently?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0060\", \"v\": [[\"can u find the docs that go w the wicker expense\"], [\"I need to dig out the paperwork for that basket I bought, so could you pull up the documents that go with the wicker expense?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0002\", \"v\": [[\"what tasks r due next week\", \"whats the steps for the return one\"], [\"tasks due next week?\", \"steps for the return one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0003\", \"v\": [[\"I finally signed up for that craft class I kept talking about, so can you add a felting lesson next monday at quarter past eleven?\", \"Different thing — we were out and about and I snapped a bunch, so what pictures do I have from yesterday?\", \"And while I'm at it, I want to put a little album together, so can you show me my favourite photos?\"], [\"add felting lesson next monday at quarter past eleven pls\", \"also what pics do i have from yesterday\", \"n show me my fave photos\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0004\", \"v\": [[\"I'm doing the budget tonight and want to see how bad it got — what was the total I spent last month?\"], [\"total spent last month?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0005\", \"v\": [[\"to-dos due next week?\", \"what's under Wedding?\"], [\"I'm trying to plan out the week ahead so nothing sneaks up on me — which to-dos are due next week?\", \"Oh, and separately, I'm pulling all the paperwork together for the big day, so what have I got filed under Wedding?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0006\", \"v\": [[\"what's left to do?\", \"wait — juggling club settlements?\", \"back to tasks: just this month\"], [\"what do i still have to do\", \"hang on quick one, show me the settlements in the juggling club group\", \"ok back to the tasks, just the ones this month pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0007\", \"v\": [[\"settle up with Dagmar in Antibes\", \"anyone owe me money?\"], [\"um can you settle up with Dagmar in, uh, Antibes?\", \"oh and… does anyone owe me cash? like, at all?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0008\", \"v\": [[\"ok so, um, add five dollars for Dagmar's lunch to Antibes — I paid for it\", \"wait who's… who's in that group?\", \"oh and, um, what's the login for the brewing club membership — not the password, just the login\"], [\"add five dollars for Dagmar's lunch to Antibes, i paid\", \"whos in it\", \"whats the login for the brewing club membership? dont need the pw\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0009\", \"v\": [[\"um, can you show me the, uh, Antibes expenses?\", \"and the ferry one — which group's that in?\", \"ok different thing, what's… what've I got planned for tuesday?\", \"and saturday?\"], [\"I'm trying to reconcile everything from that trip before I forget the details, so can I see the Antibes expenses?\", \"I'm not sure I logged it in the right place, so which group is the ferry one in?\", \"Moving on, I'm trying to figure out when I can squeeze in a haircut, so what's planned for tuesday?\", \"Hmm, that's pretty packed, so what about saturday then?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0011\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please save the storage unit code 71017 in my locker?\", \"Also, would you mind showing me what's in my Wedding folder?\", \"Would you please star all of those for me?\"], [\"save the storage unit code 71017 in the locker pls\", \"whats in my Wedding folder\", \"star all of em\"]]}","ttft_ms":27056,"type":"result","duration_ms":41568,"uuid":"45b191ba-104e-4c11-8e46-9896bcb7b2e9","ttft_stream_ms":1265,"time_to_request_ms":129,"first_content_frame_ms":1266,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22060187,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278610464.5386,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
